## Node related ignores

node_modules/
dist/
.turbo/
storybook-static/

*/**/routeTree.gen.ts

examples/*/pnpm-lock.yaml

vite.config.ts.timestamp*

## Rust related ignores

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
**/debug/
**/target/

# Remove Cargo.lock from gitignore if creating an executable, leave it for libraries
# More information here https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html
**/Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Files, generated by the code editors
.vscode/

*.tgz
# Test coverage output (cargo-llvm-cov / vitest)
coverage/

# Local Verdaccio registry (scripts/local-registry) — package storage + htpasswd
scripts/local-registry/storage/
scripts/local-registry/htpasswd
